invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_quic.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: quic.Client.init sets on_ticket whatever the values'
  takes_tickets says. A client that asked for no tickets then hashes its
  hostname, anchors and pins at init under TRUST=webpki, and keeps every
  ticket the server writes. loop_quic.zig's client with takes_tickets
  false requires a session with no on_ticket and an empty ticket slot,
  and objects.

--- old
            if (values.takes_tickets) cfg.on_ticket = onTicket;
--- new
            cfg.on_ticket = onTicket;
